Nevil Fernando Teaching Hospital (NFTH) is chosen for its quality healthcare, featuring a full\_time expert medical team, team\_based clinical decisions, a patient\_friendly environment, and ethical practices. The hospital offers modern facilities, 24/7 services, and patient\_centered care, making it a reliable choice for quality healthcare.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b0\f11\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b\f11\loch
1. Full\_Time Expert Team}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b0\f11\loch
The hospital employs a dedicated team of experienced medical professionals who are available full\_time to provide comprehensive care. These experts include specialists in various fields such as surgery, internal medicine, and pediatrics, ensuring patients receive precise and knowledgeable treatment. Their constant presence allows immediate attention to emergencies and continuity of care.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b0\f11\loch
Having full\_time experts means the hospital can offer advanced medical services and specialized procedures that require seasoned professionals. The team works with modern equipment and follows updated clinical guidelines to deliver high\_quality healthcare. This setup also supports training programs for medical students and junior staff.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b0\f11\loch
The expertise of the full\_time team enhances patient trust and satisfaction, as people know they are being treated by skilled professionals. It also improves clinical outcomes because experienced doctors can make accurate diagnoses and effective treatment plans. Overall, the team\uc2 \u8217\'81\'66s presence is a cornerstone of NFTH\u8217\'81\'66s reputation for quality care.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b\f11\loch
2. Team\_Based Decisions}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af13\langfe2052\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af11\loch\fs22\b0\f11\loch
